WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:10.043 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪♪
&gt;&gt;&gt; IS THIS DOWNTON ABBEY?

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:17.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YES.
&gt;&gt; A LETTER.

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:19.085 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪♪
&gt;&gt; WOW.

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:23.156
&gt;&gt; THE KING AND QUEEN ARE COMING
TO DOWNTON.

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:25.392 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; HERE?
BUT THIS IS A CASTLE.

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:28.862 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WELL, WE'LL NEVER PULL THIS
OFF.

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:36.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THE BELOVED TELEVISION SHOW
IS NOW A FEATURE FILM.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:39.205
&gt;&gt; AND IT'S MOSTLY CLEANING.
&gt;&gt; WE ONLY HAVE 80 SERVANTS.

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:40.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
BUTLERS, UNDERBUTLERS AND
VALETS.

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:43.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
IT'LL NEVER GET DONE IN TIME.
&gt;&gt; HOW LONG DO WE HAVE?

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:49.682 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; A YEAR AND A HALF.
&gt;&gt; WERE THE STAKES IN THE SHOW

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:51.785 align:start size:94% position:6%
ALWAYS THIS LOW?
I GUESS THEY WERE.

00:00:51.785 --> 00:00:54.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YOUR HAIR IS SO MODERN.
&gt;&gt; DO YOU LIKE IT?

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:58.024
&gt;&gt; YES.
&gt;&gt; "EXCITING FOR THE PEOPLE WHO

00:00:58.024 --> 00:01:02.262 align:start size:94% position:6%
LIKE THE SHOW," RAVES THE
"BOSTON GLOBE."

00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:04.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; MISS, WE FOUND MUD.
&gt;&gt; WHERE?

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:06.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; AT THE BOTTOM OF THE LAKE.
&gt;&gt; GOOD.

00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:12.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
THAT'S WHERE MUD GOES.
&gt;&gt; "I ABSOLUTELY LOVE THIS

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:15.275 size:75% position:38%
FILM," SAY ALL MOMS.
&gt;&gt; I NEED YOUR HELP.

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:16.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; NO.
PROBLEM.

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:20.246 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; "SO SOOTHING I WAS ON THE
BACK OF MY SEAT."

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:21.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WE'LL SERVE BREAD.
LONG BREAD.

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:24.584 align:start size:94% position:6%
BUTTER.
CHICKEN MEAT.

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:26.519 align:start size:94% position:6%
SLURPERS.
NIBBLES.

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:30.990 align:start size:94% position:6%
LITTLE BAD CAKES.
TWICE MURDERED PIGS.

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:35.462
AND OF COURSE CHICAGO STYLE DEEP
DISH PIZZA.

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:42.268
&gt;&gt; "FEELS LIKE WATCHING THE SUN
SET ON WHITE PEOPLE AS A WHOLE."

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:44.637 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I'M HAPPY.
&gt;&gt; BLIMEY.

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:46.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; BLIMEY.
&gt;&gt; YOUR MAJESTIES.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:53.246
WELCOME TO DOWNTON ABBEY.
&gt;&gt; THIS HAS BEEN AN AD FOR "THE

00:01:53.246 --> 00:01:53.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
JOKER."

